            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"statistical-analysis\">Statistical analysis</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">World Bank data for 217 economies, 1960 to 2023. The calculations are in <code>src/common/stats.py</code>, with tests in <code>tests/test_stats.py</code>. This notebook only displays them.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Click an underlined choice in a sentence to change the definition. The answer changes with it, because some answers depend on the definition.</span></span>"
