        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"question-1-gender-gap\">Question 1: gender gap</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>For which income group has the difference in average life expectancy of men and women changed the most between 1960 and 2023?</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The gender gap is women's life expectancy minus men's. The headline averages it for each income group in every year from 1960 to 2023, with each country counted in every year it has data.</span></span>"
